    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 DQ-06: 0 of 15 verified dead-code candidates were truly dead across openzeppelin, spring-petclinic, shellcheck. Causes: Spring `@ModelAttribute`, `@Bean`, `@InitBinder`; Solidity `using...for`; Haskell exports + Template Haskell. The `--exclude-annotated` flag helps for Java (61.9% -> 38.1% on spring-petclinic) but doesn't catch all patterns. Expand annotation list per language; document known per-language blind spots. Partly subsumed by U18/U19/U20 for Haskell+Solidity."  # 4f64
